         </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="quantity">Quantity <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                  <input id="quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="1" required inputmode="numeric">
                </div>
                <div class="field full">
                  <label for="street">Shipping address — street <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                  <input id="street" name="street" type="text" autocomplete="street-address" required placeholder="Street address">
                </div>
                <div class="address-heading"><strong>Where should we send it?</strong><span>Australia is selected by default</span></div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="suburb">Suburb / town <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                  <input id="suburb" name="suburb" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2" required>
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="state">State / territory <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                  <input id="state" name="state" type="text" autocomplete="address-level1" required placeholder="e.g. NSW">
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="postcode">Postcode <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                  <input id="postcode" name="postcode" type="text" autocomplete="postal-code" required inputmode="numeric">
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="country">Country <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                  <input id="country" name="country" type="text" autocomplete="country-name" value="Australia" required>
                </div>
                <div class="payment-heading">Choose a payment method</div>
                <div class="payment-options">
                  <div class="payment-option">
                    <input id="payPal" name="payment" type="radio" value="PayPal" checked>
                    <label class="payment-label" for="payPal"><span class="payment-icon">P</span><span><strong>PayPal</strong><small>Pay securely online</small></span></label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="payment-option">
                    <input id="payId" name="payment" type="radio" value="PayID">
                    <label class="payment-label" for="payId"><span class="payment-icon">$</span><span><strong>PayID</strong><small>Pay from your banking app</small></span></label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="payment-option">
                    <input id="payCash" name="payment" type="radio" value="Cash">
                    <label class="payment-label" for="payCash"><span class="payment-icon">C</span><span><strong>Cash to Justin</strong><small>Hand cash to Justin</small></span></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="field full">
                  <label for="notes">Notes <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
                  <textarea id="notes" name="notes" placeholder="Anything we should know about your order?"></textarea>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-footer">
                <div class="secure-note">No payment is taken on this page.</div>
                <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Continue to payment <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
              </div>
            </form>

            <aside class="card summary-card" aria-label="Order summary">
              <h3>Your keepsake</h3>
              <div class="summary-cover"><small>Hardcover photobook</small><strong>Journey<br>of Grace</strong><small>Turkey · Croatia · Medjugorje</small></div>
              <ul class="summary-list">
                <li><span>Format</span><strong>A4 landscape</strong></li>
                <li><span>Length</span><strong>Approx. 60 pages</strong></li>
                <li><span>Price</span><strong>$60 AUD / copy</strong></li>
              </ul>
              <div class="total-row"><span>Order total</span><strong id="liveTotal">$60</strong></div>
              <p class="summary-help">Your total updates as you choose the quantity. Shipping arrangements will be confirmed by email.</p>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="confirmation" id="confirmation" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1">
          <div class="card confirmation-card">
            <div class="confirmation-top"><div class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</div><div><h3>Thank you, <span id="confirmName">friend</span>.</h3><p>Your order details have been sent to Justin. Please complete payment using the instructions below.</p></div></div>
            <p class="next-note" id="notifyStatus" style="display:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:18px"></p>
            <div class="confirm-grid">
              <div class="instruction" id="paypalInstruction">
                <h4>Pay with PayPal</h4>
                <p id="paypalCopy">Use the button below to pay your order total. If you ordered more than one copy, the amount is already set to the full total.</p>
                <a class="button button-primary" id="paypalLink" href="https://paypal.me/pilgrimagephotobook/60AUD" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open PayPal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
              <div class="instruction" id="payidInstruction" style="display:none">
                <h4>Pay with PayID</h4>
                <p>Send <strong id="payidTotal">$60 AUD</strong> to this PayID. Use your surname followed by “BOOK” as the payment reference.</p>
                <div class="payid-box">0406 498 806</div>
                <p>After paying, Justin already has your order details from this form. He will confirm and arrange delivery.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="instruction" id="cashInstruction" style="display:none">
                <h4>Cash to Justin</h4>
                <p id="cashCopy">Please give cash to Justin for this order. Your details are sent to him when you continue; he will match your payment and arrange your copy.</p>
              </div>
</div>
            <div class="order-summary">
              <div class="order-summary-title">Your order summary</div>
              <dl>
                <dt>Name</dt><dd id="summaryName">—</dd>
                <dt>Quantity</dt><dd id="summaryQuantity">—</dd>
                <dt>Total</dt><dd id="summaryTotal">—</dd>
                <dt>Ship to</dt><dd id="summaryAddress">—</dd>
                <dt>Payment</dt><dd id="summaryPayment">—</dd>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="confirm-actions">
              <a class="button button-primary" id="emailLink" href="mailto:justin@tuenproductions.com">Email backup copy <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              <button class="back-button" id="editOrder" type="button"